{end_of_grid}

{start_of_verse: 主歌 2}
Well, I found a [G]woman,
stronger than anyone [Em]I know
She shares my [C]dreams, I hope that someday
I'll share her [D]home
I found a love, [G]
to carry [Em]more than just my secrets
To carry [C]love,
to carry children of our [D]own
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 导歌 2}
We are still kids, but we're [G]so in love,
fighting against [Em]all odds
I know we'll [C]be alright this [G]ti-ime [D]
Darling just [G]hold my hand,
be my girl, I'll [Em]be your man
I see my [C]future in your eyes [D]
{end_of_verse}

